<!DOCTYPE score-partwise PUBLIC "-//Recordare//DTD MusicXML 4.0 Partwise//EN" "http://www.musicxml.org/dtds/partwise.dtd">
<!-- A short hymn written for Hope Beacon's checks: eight bars, two parts.
     Public domain (CC0). It holds what explaining a piece must get right: a
     key and its mode, 3/4, a tempo in words and in numbers, soft, a
     crescendo, loud, rit. and very soft, syllables that join into words, and
     an octave leap. tests/the-music-room.mjs says what each should read as. -->
